Digital Signatures (like RSA, ElGamal, DSA) and their cryptanalysis;
Elliptic curve based Cryptography: The group of points on an elliptic curve; Elliptic
curves over finite fields; The curve P256; The Montgomery and Edwards curves:
curve 25519; ECDH and ECDSA;
(b) Prerequisites: None
(c) References:
1. J. Katz and Y. Lindell, Introduction to Modern Cryptography. Chapman &
Hall/CRC, 2007.
2. D. R. Stinson, Cryptography Theory and Practice. 3rd ed., Chapman & Hall/CRC,
2006.
3. D. Boneh, V. Shoup, A Graduate Course in Applied Cryptography, 2023. (Source:
http://toc.cryptobook.us).
